  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Palau Chamber of Commerce (PCOC) aims to provide strong and effective representatives of the private sector and its contribution to social and economic development. Through the Joint UNSDG Project on Digitalisation in Micronesia the ILO has extended technical assistance and support on entrepreneurship development including training of PCOC representatives on implementing the ILO Start and Improve Your Business (SIYB) Programme; and through the Pacific Climate Change Migration and Human Security Programme (PCCM-HS) Phase II, is collaborating with the Chamber to produce guidance for businesses on employment of migrant workers.</narrative>
  </description>
